          "_name": "people02",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"people02\" group=\"People\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\" selected>2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\n\t\t<header>Card</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Name\" name=\"showText\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stars\" name=\"showStars\" checked>\n\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#a66f12\" selected>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#232323\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 content-head\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-9': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<b>TESTIMONIAL</b></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\tLorem ipsum dolor sit amet nulla vel, consectetur massa adipiscing.\n\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-5 active\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\"It Just Works!!\"<br><br>\n<div>This app saved my music library. I'd bought a different program that was supposed to keep my tags correct — instead, it changed my entire library to the wrong tags and even removed my album art and artist art. My whole world stopped.\n</div><div>Then I found TagMagic. I put my entire library in the queue — it took awhile because of the size, but it came back with all the correct tags, and I was able to find all the missing artist and album art I'd lost. I would have paid a lot more for TagMagic considering what it fixed, and it let me choose — save everything, or just the tags I actually needed changed. Love this app!\n</div><div><br></div><br><div>— Chase Larkin</div></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJennifer J. Omalley\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row mt-0 mt-md-5\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Read More</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
