          "_name": "list02",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"8\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Question\" name=\"showQuestion\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#232323\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"title col-md-12 mb-5\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Privacy Policy</b></h4>\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                        List main features of your project in this block.\n                    </h4>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showQuestion\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n                                <b>What is your pricing structure?</b>\n                            </h5>\n                            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 9/16/2026<br><br><br>This policy explains what information TagMagic (the desktop application) and TagMagicStudio.com (this website) collect, and how that information is used.<br><br><br>The TagMagic Application<br><br>TagMagic is a desktop program that runs on your own computer. It does not collect, store, or transmit your personal information to us.<br><br>What TagMagic sends over the internet: When you use TagMagic's metadata correction or album/artist art features, the song, artist, and album names you're looking up are sent to third-party music databases in order to find matching information. These services include:<br><br>MusicBrainz / Cover Art Archive<br>iTunes Search API (Apple)<br>Discogs<br>Deezer<br>TheAudioDB<br>fanart.tv<br>Wikipedia<br><br>These lookups only include the text needed to identify a song or album (such as artist and album name) — never your personal information, your file paths, or any other content from your computer. Each of these third-party services has its own privacy policy governing how they handle requests sent to them.<br><br>What TagMagic stores locally: If you purchase a license, TagMagic saves your email address and license key in a small file on your own computer (used only to confirm your copy is licensed). This file stays on your computer and is never sent to us or anyone else.<br><br><br>This Website (TagMagicStudio.com)<br><br>This site is hosted using Cloudflare. We do not use separate analytics or tracking tools (such as Google Analytics) beyond what Cloudflare provides as part of standard web hosting and security (for example, basic traffic logs used to keep the site running and secure).<br><br>Downloads: The TagMagic installer is hosted via Cloudflare R2 storage. Downloading the file does not require you to provide any personal information.<br><br>Purchases: If you purchase a TagMagic license, payment is processed securely by Stripe, a third-party payment processor. We do not see or store your full payment card details — Stripe handles that directly. As part of your purchase, we receive your email address so that we can send you your license key.<br><br>How we use your email: Your email address is used to send you your license key and purchase confirmation. We do not add you to any mailing list automatically. If you'd like to receive occasional updates about TagMagic or future software, we'll only do so if you explicitly ask to be added.<br><br><br>Contact<br><br>If you have questions about this policy or how your information is handled, contact us at tagmagicstudio@outlook.com.<br><br><br>Changes to This Policy<br><br>We may update this policy from time to time as TagMagic or this website changes. The date at the top of this page will reflect the most recent update.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showQuestion\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n                                <b>How can I access my photos after the shoot?</b>\n                            </h5>\n                            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showQuestion\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n                                <b>How long does it take to receive the final photos?</b>\n                            </h5>\n                            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
