          "_name": "list02",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"8\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Question\" name=\"showQuestion\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#232323\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"title col-md-12 mb-5\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>License Terms</b></h4>\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                        List main features of your project in this block.\n                    </h4>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showQuestion\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n                                <b>What is your pricing structure?</b>\n                            </h5>\n                            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 9/16/2026<br><br><br>TagMagic License Terms\n<br>By downloading, installing, or using TagMagic (\"the Software\"), you agree to the following terms.\n<br>    1. License Grant TagMagic Studio grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to install and use the Software on your own devices, subject to these terms. This is a license to use the Software, not a sale of the Software itself — TagMagic Studio retains all rights, title, and ownership of the Software.\n<br>    2. Trial Period The Software includes a free 7-day trial period. After the trial ends, continued use requires a valid license key, obtained through a one-time purchase. License keys are tied to the email address used at the time of purchase and are for your personal use only.\n<br>    3. Your Music Files TagMagic modifies metadata and embedded artwork within the music files you choose to edit. While TagMagic is designed to only make changes you've reviewed and approved before saving, you are responsible for maintaining your own backups of your music library. TagMagic Studio is not responsible for any loss, corruption, or unintended modification of your files.\n<br>    4. No Warranty The Software is provided \"as is,\" without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement. TagMagic Studio does not guarantee the accuracy of metadata, album art, or artist art retrieved from third-party sources.\n<br>    5. Limitation of Liability To the maximum extent permitted by law, TagMagic Studio shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of, or inability to use, the Software.\n<br>    6. Third-Party Services TagMagic connects to third-party services (including MusicBrainz, Discogs, the iTunes Search API, Deezer, TheAudioDB, fanart.tv, and Wikipedia) to look up metadata and artwork. TagMagic Studio is not responsible for the availability, accuracy, or content of these third-party services.\n<br>    7. Termination This license terminates automatically if you violate these terms. Upon termination, you must stop using the Software.\n<br>    8. Contact Questions about these terms can be directed to tagmagicstudio@outlook.com.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showQuestion\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n                                <b>How can I access my photos after the shoot?</b>\n                            </h5>\n                            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showQuestion\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n                                <b>How long does it take to receive the final photos?</b>\n                            </h5>\n                            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
